msgstr "Omogočanje avtentikacije JWT ni uspelo"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To implement SSO you will need to add a new endpoint to your app. You can connect Metabase to your identity provider using JSON Web Tokens (JWT) to authenticate people. Enabling JWT authentication will also create a signing key and enable group sync."
msgstr "Za implementacijo SSO boš moral v svojo aplikacijo dodati nov endpoint. Metabase lahko povežeš s svojim ponudnikom identitete z uporabo JSON Web Tokens (JWT) za avtentikacijo ljudi. Omogočanje avtentikacije JWT bo tudi ustvarilo podpisni ključ in omogočilo sinhronizacijo skupin."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "This is where Metabase will redirect login requests"
msgstr "Tja bo Metabase preusmeril zahteve za prijavo"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Enable JWT authentication and continue"
msgstr "Omogoči avtentikacijo JWT in nadaljuj"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to save SSO test status"
msgstr "Shranjevanje statusa testa SSO ni uspelo"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try logging in with SSO. Did it work?"
msgstr "Poskusi se prijaviti s SSO. Je delovalo?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To check if JWT authentication was configured successfully, open Metabase in a different browser or in a private tab and try logging in to your account using single sign-on (SSO). Is login working correctly?"
msgstr "Če želiš preveriti, ali je bila avtentikacija JWT uspešno nastavljena, odpri Metabase v drugem brskalniku ali v zasebnem zavihku in se poskusi prijaviti v svoj račun z enotno prijavo (SSO). Ali prijava deluje pravilno?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "No, I couldn't log in"
msgstr "Ne, nisem se mogel prijaviti"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Log in works, I'm done"
msgstr "Prijava deluje, končal sem"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Odpravljanje težav"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try the steps below before testing JWT authentication again. If nothing works, consider contacting support."
msgstr "Preden ponovno testiraš avtentikacijo JWT, poskusi spodnje korake. Če nič ne deluje, razmisli o tem, da kontaktiraš podporo."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "404 error after SSO sign-in"
msgstr "Napaka 404 po prijavi s SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Če po kliku na \"Sign in with SSO\" brskalnik vrne napako 404, preveri, da vrednost JWT SSO URI v skrbniških nastavitvah / auth / JWT kaže na tvoj endpoint ter da tvoj endpoint deluje in je dosegljiv."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "Napaka dešifriranja JWT: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Če po preusmeritvi iz tvoje aplikacije v Metabase vidiš \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", je prišlo do težave pri dešifriranju podpisanega JWT. Preveri, da ima METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET pravo vrednost."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Napaka neujemanja ID-ja najemnika"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Če po preusmeritvi iz tvoje aplikacije v Metabase vidiš sporočilo o napaki \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", se tvoja aplikacija poskuša prijaviti uporabnika z napačnim slug-om najemnika. Preglej claim @tenant v JWT in se prepričaj, da se ujema z najemnikom, kateremu pripada ta uporabnik najemnika."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Provisioning uporabnikov je onemogočen za JWT SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Če po preusmeritvi iz tvoje aplikacije v Metabase vidiš sporočilo o napaki \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO.\", je provisioning uporabnikov za JWT SSO izklopljen v skrbniških nastavitvah/avtentikacija. To funkcijo vključi, da se uporabnikom samodejno ustvari račun, če še ne obstaja, ali pa poskrbi, da uporabniki obstajajo, preden jih prijaviš prek JWT SSO."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Contact customer support"
msgstr "Kontaktiraj podporo strankam"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Set up JWT authentication"
msgstr "Nastavi avtentikacijo JWT"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Add a new endpoint to your app"
msgstr "V svojo aplikacijo dodaj nov endpoint"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Test that JWT authentication is working correctly"
msgstr "Preveri, da avtentikacija JWT deluje pravilno"

