#: metabase/agent_lib/representations.clj
msgid "Stage {0} has unknown key(s): {1}. Valid stage keys are: {2}."
msgstr "Stage {0} ima neznan(e) ključ(e): {1}. Veljavni ključi stopnje so: {2}."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Detected a post-aggregation filter alongside `order-by:`, `limit:`, or `fields:` in the same stage. MBQL 5 requires the filter in a separate stage, but those trailing clauses cannot be safely relocated — they may reference pre-aggregation columns that don''t survive the split. Please author this as two stages explicitly: stage 0 with `source-table`, `aggregation`, `breakout`, and any pre-aggregation `filters`; stage 1 with the post-aggregation `filters`, plus `order-by` / `limit` / `fields` that reference the aggregation''s output via cross-stage `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]` refs."
msgstr "Zaznan post-agregacijski filter skupaj z `order-by:`, `limit:` ali `fields:` v isti fazi. MBQL 5 zahteva filter v ločeni fazi, vendar teh zaključnih klavzul ni mogoče varno prestaviti — lahko se sklicujejo na pred-agregacijske stolpce, ki ne preživijo razdelitve. To prosimo eksplicitno zapišite kot dve fazi: faza 0 z `source-table`, `aggregation`, `breakout` in morebitnimi pred-agregacijskimi `filters`; faza 1 s post-agregacijskimi `filters` ter `order-by` / `limit` / `fields`, ki se na izhod agregacije sklicujejo prek medfaznih referenc `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]`."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "The query builder''s expression editor rejects a {0} clause in stage {1}: {2}. The query would build but could not be visualized or saved - rewrite the offending clause."
msgstr "Urejevalnik izrazov graditelja poizvedb zavrne klavzulo {0} v fazi {1}: {2}. Poizvedba bi se sestavila, vendar je ne bi bilo mogoče vizualizirati ali shraniti – prepišite sporno klavzulo."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} can be reached from {1} via {2} foreign keys. Specify the `source-field` option on the field clause to disambiguate; call `read_resource` with `metabase://table/<numeric id>/fields` for the source table to list the available foreign-key columns."
msgstr "Polje {0} je mogoče doseči iz {1} prek {2} tujih ključev. Za razločitev navedite možnost `source-field` v klavzuli polja; pokličite `read_resource` z `metabase://table/<numeric id>/fields` za izvorno tabelo, da izpišete razpoložljive stolpce tujih ključev."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`field` clause needs a portable FK in its third slot, not a numeric id. Use a vector `[<database>, <schema>, <table>, <column>]` (resolved against the metadata provider) or a string column-name (for cross-stage references)."
msgstr "Klavzula `field` potrebuje prenosljiv FK v tretjem polju, ne številčnega ID-ja. Uporabite vektor `[<database>, <schema>, <table>, <column>]` (razrešen prek ponudnika metapodatkov) ali niz z imenom stolpca (za sklice med stopnjami)."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} is on table {1}, which has no foreign key from the source table {2}, so it cannot be reached implicitly. To group or filter by a column from that table, add an explicit `joins:` entry and reference the field using the join alias. If you are aggregating a metric that relates to that table (metrics can join tables that have no foreign key), read that metric dimensions resource `metabase://metric/<metric_id>/dimensions` which lists the exact join clause to paste into `joins:` and the columns it unlocks. Otherwise use a field from the source table."
msgstr "Polje {0} je v tabeli {1}, ki nima tujega ključa iz izvorne tabele {2}, zato do nje ni mogoče implicitno dostopati. Če želite grupirati ali filtrirati po stolpcu iz te tabele, dodajte ekspliciten vnos `joins:` in se na polje sklicujte z aliasom joina. Če agregirate metriko, ki je povezana s to tabelo (metrike lahko združujejo tabele brez tujega ključa), preberite vir dimenzij te metrike `metabase://metric/<metric_id>/dimensions`, ki navaja natančno join klavzulo za lepljenje v `joins:` in stolpce, ki jih odklene. Sicer uporabite polje iz izvorne tabele."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`{0}` is not a clause in repr; it was a top-level operation in the older sexp pipeline. {1}"
msgstr "`{0}` ni klavzula v repr; v starejšem sexp pipeline-u je bila to operacija na vrhnji ravni. {1}"

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Aggregation index {0} out of range; stage has {1} aggregation(s): {2}"
msgstr "Aggregation index {0} je izven obsega; stopnja ima {1} agregacij(o/e): {2}"

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "No column named {0} is available to reference in this stage. Reference a column by its machine name (e.g. an aggregation is `max`, `count`, `sum` - never its display label like `Max of X`), not a UI label. Available column names: {1}."
msgstr "V tej fazi ni na voljo noben stolpec z imenom {0}, na katerega bi se lahko sklicevali. Na stolpec se sklicujte z njegovim strojnim imenom (npr. agregacija je `max`, `count`, `sum` – nikoli njegov prikazni naziv, kot je `Max of X`), ne z oznako v UI. Razpoložljiva imena stolpcev: {1}."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`case` (and `if`) uses its third positional argument as the fallback value, not a `default` key in the options map. Move the value out of the options map and append it as the third arg of the clause: `[case, <opts>, <branch-pairs>, <default>]`. Omit the third arg entirely if you have no fallback (the result will be null on miss)."
msgstr "`case` (in `if`) uporablja svoj tretji pozicijski argument kot nadomestno vrednost, ne ključa `default` v zemljevidu možnosti. Vrednost premaknite iz zemljevida možnosti in jo dodajte kot tretji argument klavzule: `[case, <opts>, <branch-pairs>, <default>]`. Tretji argument v celoti izpustite, če nadomestne vrednosti nimate (rezultat bo ob zgrešitvi null)."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Detected a post-aggregation filter (a filter referencing an aggregation from the same stage). MBQL 5 requires this in a separate stage. Auto-fix is unsafe here — either an aggregation''s output column name cannot be derived (e.g. a `metric` reference or unknown head), or two aggregations in this stage would produce the same column name (e.g. two `sum` aggregations on different fields, which lib disambiguates as `sum` / `sum_2` based on field order). Please refactor to multi-stage manually: put the aggregations in stage 0, and the filter in stage 1 referencing the column via a cross-stage `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]` clause. Use an explicit aggregation with a `name` opts override (e.g. `[\"sum\", (opts with key \"name\" → \"sum_total\"), …]`) if you need stable cross-stage names."
msgstr "Zaznan post-agregacijski filter (filter, ki se sklicuje na agregacijo iz iste faze). MBQL 5 zahteva to v ločeni fazi. Samodejno popravljanje tu ni varno — bodisi izhodnega imena stolpca agregacije ni mogoče izpeljati (npr. referenca `metric` ali neznana glava) ali pa bi dve agregaciji v tej fazi ustvarili enako ime stolpca (npr. dve agregaciji `sum` na različnih poljih, ki ju knjižnica razločuje kot `sum` / `sum_2` glede na vrstni red polj). Prosimo, ročno preoblikujte v večfazno: agregacije dajte v fazo 0, filter pa v fazo 1, pri čemer se na stolpec sklicujte prek medfazne klavzule `[\"field\", (empty opts), \"<column-name>\"]`. Uporabite eksplicitno agregacijo z nastavitvijo `name` v opts (npr. `[\"sum\", (opts s ključem \"name\" → \"sum_total\"), …]`), če potrebujete stabilna medfazna imena."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Field {0} is reachable from {1} explicit joins via aliases {2}. Specify the `source-field-join-alias` option on the field clause to pick which join''s foreign key to use."
msgstr "Do polja {0} je mogoče priti prek {1} eksplicitnih joinov z vzdevki {2}. Navedite možnost `source-field-join-alias` na klavzuli field, da izberete, kateri tuji ključ joina uporabiti."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "`[expression, <opts>, <name>]` reference requires a non-blank string identifier in the third slot, matching an entry in some stage''s `expressions:` block."
msgstr "Sklic `[expression, <opts>, <name>]` zahteva ne-prazen identifikator niza v tretjem polju, ki se ujema z vnosom v bloku `expressions:` neke stopnje."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Found an integer-indexed aggregation reference but this stage has no `aggregation:` clause"
msgstr "Najden je bil sklic na agregacijo z celoštevilčnim indeksom, vendar ta stopnja nima klavzule `aggregation:`"

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/repair.clj
msgid "Stage {0} aggregation entry {1} is a `field` clause, not an aggregation. The `aggregation:` block expects aggregation functions like `count`, `sum`, `avg`, `metric`, etc. - or wrap the field in one (e.g. `[sum, <opts>, <field>]`). If you wanted to group by this column, use `breakout:` instead."
msgstr "Vnos agregacije {1} v stopnji {0} je klavzula `field`, ne agregacija. Blok `aggregation:` pričakuje agregacijske funkcije, kot so `count`, `sum`, `avg`, `metric` itd. — ali pa polje ovijte v eno (npr. `[sum, <opts>, <field>]`). Če ste želeli razčleniti po tem stolpcu, uporabite `breakout:`."

#: metabase/agent_lib/representations/resolve.clj
msgid "Invalid temporal literal {0} in :absolute-datetime — use an ISO-8601 date, datetime, year, or year-month."
msgstr "Neveljaven časovni literal {0} v :absolute-datetime — uporabite datum, datum in čas, leto ali leto-mesec v ISO-8601."

