"- allow-private (external + private networks but NOT loopback or link-local)\n"
"- allow-all (no restrictions).\n"
"Defaults to external-only on Metabase Cloud and allow-all when self-hosted.\n"
"Also covers the SSH tunnel host and the database auth-provider URLs."
msgstr "Nadzira, v katera omrežja se lahko Metabase poveže za povezave z data warehouse.\n"
"Možnosti:\n"
"- external-only (samo globalno usmerljivi javni naslovi)\n"
"- allow-private (zunanja + zasebna omrežja, vendar NE loopback ali link-local)\n"
"- allow-all (brez omejitev).\n"
"Privzeto je external-only v Metabase Cloud in allow-all pri samogostovanju.\n"
"Pokriva tudi gostitelja SSH tunela in URL-je ponudnikov preverjanja pristnosti podatkovne baze."

