msgstr "Ime modela je obvezno. Pričakovan format: povezava/model, npr. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Metabot provider must be a string, got: {0}"
msgstr "Ponudnik Metabot mora biti niz, prejeto: {0}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Number of days to retain rows in the ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, and metabot_message tables. Minimum value is 30; set to 0 to retain data indefinitely."
msgstr "Število dni, koliko časa naj se ohranijo vrstice v tabelah ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation in metabot_message. Najmanjša vrednost je 30; nastavite na 0, da podatke hranite neomejeno."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the SQL generation experience."
msgstr "Navodila po meri, dodana Metabotovemu sistemskemu pozivu za izkušnjo generiranja SQL."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the chat experience (the AI sidebar and embedded Metabot)."
msgstr "Navodila po meri, dodana Metabotovemu sistemskemu pozivu za izkušnjo klepeta (AI stranska vrstica in vdelani Metabot)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "Povezava ponudnika AI in model, ki se uporabljata za hitra opravila v ozadju, kot je poimenovanje pogovorov Metabot, v istem formatu ključ-povezave/ime-modela kot `llm-metabot-provider`. Privzeto je najhitrejši model, ki ga ponuja povezava, na kateri teče Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Povezava ponudnika AI in model za Metabot. Format: ključ-povezave/ime-modela, npr. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. Ključ povezave poimenuje vnos v nastavitvi `llm-providers` in je privzeto vrsta ponudnika."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether the user''s recently viewed items are included in the Metabot system prompt."
msgstr "Ali so uporabnikovi nedavno ogledani elementi vključeni v sistemski poziv Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether Metabot is enabled for regular usage."
msgstr "Ali je Metabot omogočen za običajno uporabo."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Invalid Azure model {0}. Expected format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> where <family> is one of: {1}"
msgstr "Neveljaven Azure model {0}. Pričakovan format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> kjer je <family> eden od: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Multiple databases share the name `{0}` (ids: {1}). The agent has no way to disambiguate; ask the user to rename one of the databases or use a more specific identifier."
msgstr "Več zbirk podatkov ima ime `{0}` (ids: {1}). Agent ne more razločiti; uporabnika prosite, naj preimenuje eno od zbirk podatkov ali uporabi bolj specifičen identifikator."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "First stage must have either `source-table:` (as a portable FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`) or `source-card:` (as an entity_id string). Neither was found in `stages[0]`."
msgstr "Prva stopnja mora imeti bodisi `source-table:` (kot prenosljiv FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`) bodisi `source-card:` (kot niz entity_id). Noben ni bil najden v `stages[0]`."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "`source-table:` does not accept URIs like `{0}`. {1}"
msgstr "`source-table:` ne sprejema URI-jev, kot je `{0}`. {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "The constructed query is not runnable - it would fail the query builder''s validation, so it cannot be visualized or saved. This usually means a field reference is missing its type or names a column that does not exist, or an aggregation/window function (e.g. `offset`) was placed in `expressions:` (custom columns) where it is not allowed - move it to `aggregation:` or `order-by:`. Schema validation details: {0}"
msgstr "Sestavljene poizvedbe ni mogoče zagnati – ne bi prestala validacije graditelja poizvedb, zato je ni mogoče vizualizirati ali shraniti. To običajno pomeni, da sklic na polje nima določenega tipa ali pa navaja stolpec, ki ne obstaja, ali pa je bila agregacija/okenska funkcija (npr. `offset`) umeščena v `expressions:` (stolpci po meri), kjer ni dovoljena – premaknite jo v `aggregation:` ali `order-by:`. Podrobnosti validacije sheme: {0}"

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Unknown database: `{0}`. Use the exact database name as reported by search / `read_resource` (it appears as the first element of every portable FK, e.g. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."
msgstr "Neznana zbirka podatkov: `{0}`. Uporabite natančno ime zbirke podatkov, kot ga vrne search / `read_resource` (prikaže se kot prvi element vsakega prenosnega FK, npr. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
#: metabase/models/serialization/resolve/mp.clj
msgid "No saved question or model found with entity_id {0}. Do not invent or guess entity_ids: call `read_resource` with `metabase://question/<numeric id>` or `metabase://model/<numeric id>` first, then copy the exact `portable_entity_id` from the response into `source-card:`."
msgstr "Ni bilo mogoče najti shranjenega vprašanja ali modela z entity_id {0}. Ne izmišljajte si in ne ugibajte entity_ids: najprej pokličite `read_resource` z `metabase://question/<numeric id>` ali `metabase://model/<numeric id>`, nato iz odgovora kopirajte natančen `portable_entity_id` v `source-card:`."

