msgstr "Ime modela, posredovano ponudniku vdelav osi sopomenk."

#: metabase_enterprise/data_complexity_score/settings.clj
msgid "Internal bookkeeping: Fingerprint of last successful run, to prevent needless re-calculations."
msgstr "Interno knjigovodstvo: prstni odtis zadnjega uspešnega zagona, da se preprečijo nepotrebni preračuni."

#: metabase_enterprise/data_complexity_score/settings.clj
msgid "Deprecated: the :data-complexity-score premium feature token is the authoritative gate for the scheduled scoring job. Retained as a read-only fallback so existing overrides keep working — values from the MB_DATA_COMPLEXITY_SCORING_ENABLED env var or previously persisted DB rows are still honored, but the setting can no longer be changed at runtime."
msgstr "Zastarelo: premium žeton funkcije :data-complexity-score je avtoritativna kontrola za načrtovano opravilo točkovanja. Ohranjeno kot samo za branje nadomestno, da obstoječe preglasitve še naprej delujejo — vrednosti iz env var MB_DATA_COMPLEXITY_SCORING_ENABLED ali prej shranjenih vrstic DB so še vedno upoštevane, vendar nastavitve ni več mogoče spreminjati med izvajanjem."

