msgstr "Kanal Slack za obvestila Security Center. Null pomeni, da so Slack obvestila onemogočena."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default pgvector `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` (soft cap on tuples an iterative scan visits) for the `hnsw-iterative-*` strategies. Larger values improve recall under selective filters at the cost of latency. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_max_scan_tuples` API parameter."
msgstr "Privzeti pgvector `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` (mehka omejitev števila tuplov, ki jih obišče iterativno skeniranje) za strategije `hnsw-iterative-*`. Večje vrednosti izboljšajo priklic pri selektivnih filtrih na račun latence. Posamezne zahteve lahko to prepišejo prek API parametra `vector_search_max_scan_tuples`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours to retain stale semantic search indexes before cleanup."
msgstr "Število ur, koliko časa naj se zastareli indeksi semantičnega iskanja hranijo pred čiščenjem."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default vector-search strategy for semantic search: `hnsw` (approximate, HNSW-index-backed), `brute-force` (exact, applies non-vector filters first then computes cosine distance over the survivors), or `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (HNSW-index-backed iterative scans with inline filters). Defaults to `brute-force`, which needs no index; selecting `hnsw` builds the HNSW index just-in-time. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_strategy` API parameter."
msgstr "Privzeta strategija vektorskega iskanja za semantično iskanje: `hnsw` (približna, podprta z indeksom HNSW), `brute-force` (natančna, najprej uporabi nevektorske filtre, nato izračuna kosinusno razdaljo na preživelih), ali `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (iterativna skeniranja, podprta z indeksom HNSW, z vgrajenimi filtri). Privzeto je `brute-force`, ki ne potrebuje indeksa; izbira `hnsw` zgradi indeks HNSW sproti. Posamezne zahteve lahko to prepišejo prek parametra API `vector_search_strategy`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "API key for authenticating with the embedding service. Leave empty for proxying thorugh ai-service. In that case premium-embedding-token is used for authentication."
msgstr "API ključ za avtentikacijo z embedding storitvijo. Pustite prazno za posredovanje prek ai-service. V tem primeru se za avtentikacijo uporabi premium-embedding-token."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Minimum number of semantic search results required before falling back to other engines."
msgstr "Najmanjše število rezultatov semantičnega iskanja, preden se preklopi na druge iskalnike."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Run EXPLAIN (ANALYZE) instrumentation of the inner vector subquery for every semantic search? Expensive (re-executes the inner query); intended for ad-hoc analysis. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_explain` API parameter."
msgstr "Zagnati instrumentacijo EXPLAIN (ANALYZE) notranje vektorske podpoizvedbe za vsako semantično iskanje? Drago (ponovno izvede notranjo poizvedbo); namenjeno ad-hoc analizi. Posamezne zahteve lahko to prepišejo prek API parametra `vector_search_explain`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "The maximum number of tokens sent in a single embedding API call."
msgstr "Največje število tokenov, poslanih v enem API klicu za embeddings."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Set the dimension size for the selected embedding model"
msgstr "Nastavi velikost dimenzije za izbrani embedding model"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (HNSW candidate-list size) for the `hnsw-iterative-*` strategies. Larger values improve recall at the cost of latency. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_ef_search` API parameter."
msgstr "Privzeti pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (velikost seznama kandidatov HNSW) za strategije `hnsw-iterative-*`. Večje vrednosti izboljšajo priklic na račun latence. Posamezne zahteve lahko to prepišejo prek API parametra `vector_search_ef_search`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of threads to use for batched index updates, including embedding requests"
msgstr "Število niti za paketne posodobitve indeksa, vključno z zahtevami za embeddings"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Maximum number of results to return from a single semantic search query."
msgstr "Največje število rezultatov, vrnjenih iz ene poizvedbe semantičnega iskanja."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Set the embedding model for the selected provider"
msgstr "Nastavi embedding model za izbranega ponudnika"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "The registered embedding provider to use"
msgstr "Registrirani ponudnik vdelav, ki bo uporabljen"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Wrap embedding-service calls in a circuit breaker that fails fast after repeated failures. Runtime kill switch; the breaker thresholds are fixed."
msgstr "Ovijte klice embedding-service v circuit breaker, ki po ponavljajočih se napakah hitro odpove. Runtime kill switch; pragovi breakerja so fiksni."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "URL of the OpenAI-compatible embedding service (e.g. a LiteLLM proxy)."
msgstr "URL OpenAI-združljive storitve vdelav (npr. posrednik LiteLLM)."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours to retain tombstone records in the gate table before cleanup."
msgstr "Število ur, koliko časa naj se zapisi \"tombstone\" v tabeli gate hranijo pred čiščenjem."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Number of hours until repair tables are considered stale and eligible for cleanup, if they were not\n"
"    cleaned up successfully after use."
msgstr "Število ur, po katerih se popravne tabele obravnavajo kot zastarele in primerne za čiščenje, če po uporabi niso bile\n"
"    uspešno počiščene."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Prefix prepended to search queries (but not indexed documents) before embedding them, as expected by asymmetric retrieval models such as the snowflake-arctic-embed family. It is prepended verbatim, so include any trailing separator. Leave empty to use the default for the model, which varies by generation: Arctic Embed v2.0 expects `query: `, earlier versions expect a longer instruction."
msgstr "Predpona, dodana iskalnim poizvedbam (ne pa indeksiranim dokumentom) pred vdelavo, kot to pričakujejo asimetrični modeli pridobivanja, kot je družina snowflake-arctic-embed. Dodana je dobesedno, zato vključite morebitno končno ločilo. Pustite prazno, da uporabite privzeto vrednost za model, ki se razlikuje glede na generacijo: Arctic Embed v2.0 pričakuje `query: `, starejše različice pričakujejo daljše navodilo."

